From: Cris Sinnott <csinnott@qnx.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:33:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add QNX support

---
 include/ntp_machine.h   |  7 ++++
 include/qnx/sys/timex.h | 78 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libntp/adjtime_qnx.c    | 73 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libntp/wscript          |  3 ++
 wscript                 | 14 ++++++--
 5 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/qnx/sys/timex.h
